// Conformance fixture for ta.mom (S-bead OpenBBTechnical-0e9.5.36, Wave 5B-4).
//
// Author-derivative posture per PRD §7.3: reference output computed by
// hand-executing the momentum formula (identical to ta.change with
// explicit length) against a hard-coded synthetic close series (see
